//! The noise package: randomness a Kernel can repeat, as functions and no
//! Kernels. Hashes of whole numbers, the same bits on every backend;
//! value and gradient noise in two and three dimensions; fractal sums of
//! them (fbm) and their ridged kin; Worley's cells; and curl noise, a
//! swirl that neither gathers nor spreads, for pushing smoke about.
package noise@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
